{"id":"00213","root":"uni00213_1","name":{"ja":"柳　六穂","en":"Yanagi Mutsuho"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"柳　六穂","en":"Yanagi Mutsuho"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin","Poisoner"],"release":"2019-07-16","limited":true,"characterId":158,"profile":{"ja":"古くからある対魔忍の家系に生まれた。柳家の者は代々体内で毒を生成する事ができる体質の持ち主で、あらゆる毒への耐性も持つ。六穂も例外ではなく、学園を卒業後、主に斥候、潜入、暗殺などの任務に就いている。わざと敵の攻撃を受けたり、あえて捕えられたりといった危険な状況に身を置く事も多いが、自らの身を危険に晒して敵を屠る事はもっとも自分に合っていると自負している。一方、自らの家系、体質から、普通の恋愛や生活は諦めているが、心の底ではそれを求めてしまっている。その矛盾が鬱屈した性格を形成しており、「リア充とか……死んじゃうといいのにね～」などとこぼす事も。","en":"Yanagi Mutsuho was born into a long-standing Taimanin lineage. Members of the Yanagi family possess a hereditary ability to generate toxins within their bodies and are resistant to all poisons. Mutsuho is no exception; after graduating from the academy she primarily undertakes scouting, infiltration, and assassination missions. She often places herself in dangerous situations—deliberately taking enemy attacks or allowing herself to be captured—believing that risking her own life to slay foes suits her best. Though her family heritage and physiology force her to forgo ordinary romance and a normal life, deep down she still longs for them. This contradiction fuels a brooding personality, leading her to mutter things like, \"People who are all happy… I wish they'd just die.\""},"illustrator":"ユージ","voiceActor":"瀬名ゆず希","forms":[{"id":"uni00213_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[952,1904],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[149,298],"def":[112,224],"spd":[84,84],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["2","250001"],"evolve":[["evo00004",5],["evo00005",15],["evo00006",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00213_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1404,2808],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[233,466],"def":[159,318],"spd":[84,84],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["2","250001","250002"],"evolve":[["evo00005",10],["evo00006",15],["evo00016",4],["evo00017",2]]},{"id":"uni